{"adjusted_volatile_messages": [["user","Prepare an unapproved reusable draft; no execution."]], "bridge_messages": [], "composition_summary": "Drafted one unapproved pure-logic class-22 component. The helper receives the raw inputs mapping and is called at module scope to assign result. It distinguishes optional_channel absent (category omitted/null), explicit null (category unset/null), exact integer -80..-70 (category accepted/original), and everything else (category bad/null). Result keys are exactly category and optional_channel. No exceptions, coercion, defaults, host calls, imports, or I/O. No execution, submission, Q1/Q2 or activation was performed by this example reviewer.", "proposed_components": [{"class_code": 22, "payload": {"name": "pc-fresh-presence-helper", "description": "optional_channel absent -> category omitted/null; explicit null -> category unset/null; exact integer -80..-70 -> category accepted/original; anything else -> category bad/null. Result keys are exactly category and optional_channel. No exceptions, coercion, defaults, host calls, imports or I/O. Target typed inputs interface requires selected-runner support; unapproved draft, not submitted or activated.", "content": "def classify_channel(mapping):
